#: antispamwizard.cpp:809
msgid ""
"Sometimes messages are classified wrongly or even not at all; the latter "
"might be by intention, because you perhaps filter out messages from mailing "
"lists before you let the anti-spam tools classify the rest of the messages. "
"You can correct these wrong or missing classifications manually by using the "
"appropriate toolbar buttons which trigger special filters created by this "
"wizard."
msgstr ""

#: antispamwizard.cpp:818
msgid "Classify messages using the anti-spam tools"
