#. i18n: file encryptionconfigurationdialog.ui line 342
#: rc.cpp:395
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Warn If CRL Expires In The Near Future</h1>\n"
"If this box is checked, you will be warned if one of the CRLs you are using "
"is about to expire in the near future.\n"
