msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Opaque signed messages</h1>\n"
"When this option is selected, both the signature and the signed data will be "
"encoded into one ASN.1 block. Messages will be readable only by Mail User "
"Agents supporting ASN.1 decoding.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Negeseuon llofnodedig afloyw</h1>\n"
"Pan ddewisir y dewisiad yma, amgodir y llofnod a'r data llofnodedig i mewn i "
"un bloc ASN.1.  Bydd negeseuon yn ddarllenadwy gan Asiantau Defnyddiwr Ebost "
"sy'n cynnal datgodiad ASN.1 yn unig.\n"
"</qt>"

#. i18n: file signatureconfigurationdialog.ui line 404
